  "notes": [
    "The 4N35 datasheet (Vishay Doc. 81181) covers three CTR-identical grades (4N35, 4N36, 4N37, all CTR > 100 %); this document describes the 4N35 orderable grade only, per the one-grade-per-document rule.",
    "The INPUT section of the Electrical Characteristics prints two separately-symboled LED capacitances at the same conditions (VR = 0 V, f = 1 MHz): Junction capacitance Cj = 50 pF and Capacitance CO = 25 pF. Both are preserved as measurements under input_capacitance rather than choosing between them.",
    "Absolute-maximum input and output power dissipation are both 70 mW on this part; each is captured on its own key (input_power_dissipation, collector_power_dissipation)."
  ],
